Bind Npc 31774 Zone 21

On greeting
    Say "Which info do you wish to learn?"
    Topic "[Akara Altar]" goto welcome
    Topic "I Love Knight online" goto love_knight_online
    Topic "I will continue playing knight online" goto continue_playing
    Topic "[Exchange] I love knight online Emblem Voucher" goto emblem_vouchers

On welcome
    Say "Welcome! I'm a goddess \"Akara.\" Do you wish to earn my accessories? Check out \"Akara's Altar\" now. Do you wish to proceed?"
    Topic "[Akara Altar] How to Use" goto how_to_use
    Topic "Yes, count me in!" goto altar

On how_to_use
    Say "Welcome! I'm a goddess \"Akara.\" Do you wish to earn my accessories? Check out \"Akara's Altar\" now. Do you wish to proceed?"
    Topic "[Akara Altar] Basic Info" goto basic_info
    Topic "Bidding and Claim" goto bidding
    Topic "[Akara Altar] Time" goto time

On altar
    Open special auction panel

On love_knight_online
    Open post board 0

On continue_playing
    Open post board 1

On emblem_vouchers
    Say "Every post on my boards earns an I love knight online Emblem Exchange Voucher. Bring me the voucher and I will give you the I love knight online Emblem for as many days as it says."
    Topic "Emblem Exchange Voucher (1day)" goto emblem_1_day if player has 811084000
    Topic "Emblem Exchange Voucher (3days)" goto emblem_3_days if player has 811085000
    Topic "Emblem Exchange Voucher (7days)" goto emblem_7_days if player has 811086000
    Topic "Emblem Exchange Voucher (15days)" goto emblem_15_days if player has 811087000
    Topic "Emblem Exchange Voucher (30days)" goto emblem_30_days if player has 811088000
    Topic "Decorative Emblem Exchange Voucher" goto decorative_emblem if player has 811089000
    Topic "I'll just go." goto close
    If no topic fits
        Say "You don't have an I love knight online Emblem Exchange Voucher. Post on the I Love Knight online or the I will continue playing knight online board to earn one."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On emblem_1_day
    Trade 1 of 811084000 for 1 of 1113329000 for 24 hours

On emblem_3_days
    Trade 1 of 811085000 for 1 of 1113329000 for 3 days

On emblem_7_days
    Trade 1 of 811086000 for 1 of 1113329000 for 7 days

On emblem_15_days
    Trade 1 of 811087000 for 1 of 1113329000 for 15 days

On emblem_30_days
    Trade 1 of 811088000 for 1 of 1113329000 for 30 days

On decorative_emblem
    Trade 1 of 811089000 for 1 of 1113330000

On basic_info
    Say "Akara's Altar is an auction house where you can earn various of items and anyone can join. If you would like to join, I can tell you how and guide you though it. Once you place a bid, you cannot withdraw so please be careful when you place a bid. *Auction House is operated in each channel separately.*"
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On bidding
    Say "In order to join Akara's Altar, you need to purchase Mithril Check from Chief NPC and place a bid. Also, you can check the available bid prices for each items, so try placing bid according to available bid prices. You can refresh bid price using Refresh button. *Note* You cannot use Mithril Check earned from Merchant Union Fund for Akara's Altar"
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On time
    Say "Akara's Altar Bidding is available 23:05 ~ 22:55 next day. You cannot check items during 23:00 ~ 23:05 (Preparation time). Please be aware of this and place your bid."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close
